    "上の点線より上に盆栽が 1 秒以上とどまると終わりです。落としている途中で線をまたぐぶんは数えません。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The game ends if a bonsai stays above the dotted line at the top for 1 second or more. A bonsai crossing the line as it falls doesn't count."
